      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Edgar%2C_Montana",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Edgar sits near the Crow Indian Reservation and close to Pryor, the gravesite of Crow chief Plenty Coups.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
